= Liao Zhongkai Appointed as CEC Chairman

After a quick election due to Sun Yat-sen's death, Liao Zhongkai came out on top as the Chairman of the Central Executive Committee. This has strengthened the Communist faction significantly, as Liao now takes the highest position in the Party.
